   "_note": "D1191 (Vincent, Tue Nov 3, 2026, 11:17 AM ET): the props switch on who controls the town. Each `when` reads cond()'s hold:<node>=<id> term, which asks mapHold() (game.js REGION_MAP fernbrook hold rules), so the props can never drift from the map. D1432 (Vincent, Nov 3, 2026) layers on top: until story.fen_turned is set (nothing sets it yet) every prop keeps the split look, so each look term also reads story.fen_turned; once it is set the props follow the hold. D1727 (pending Vincent) would read story.fen_turned=<side> instead of the hold.",
